[statement]
Reduced from postmarketOS v26.06 over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and
`community`, 2026-11-11), asked for `akonadi-calendar`; the records it
keeps are all Alpine's. `qtkeychain` needs `dbus:org.freedesktop.Secrets`,
which `gnome-keyring`, of priority 100, and `kwallet` provide at no
version; `kaccounts-integration` needs `kwallet` through
`so:libKF6Wallet.so.6`. apk installs `gnome-keyring` beside `kwallet`.
Observed; the secrets family, in a shape the rules that settled v3.24's
names do not reach. Over v3.24 alone, `akonadi-calendar` agrees; over
postmarketOS's repository and v3.24 it differs only while the index holds
`b4`, a record no resolution of the request reaches.

